                <pb facs="0968" n="907" sameAs="frus:frus1977-80v02/pg907"/>


                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#bold">Memorandum From President Carter to Secretary of State
                        Vance, Secretary of Agriculture Bergland, the Director of the Office of
                        Management and Budget (McIntyre), and the Director of the International
                        Development Cooperation Agency (Ehrlich)</hi><anchor n="5" xml:id="d272-f1"
                    />
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1980-04-24">April 24, 1980</date>
                    </dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Review of the Report of the Presidential Commission on World Hunger</item>
                </list>
                <p>The President has requested that the Director of the International Development
                    Cooperation Agency arrange for thorough review by all directly interested
                    Executive Branch departments and agencies of recommendations regarding
                    international action of the Presidential Commission on World Hunger. The
                    conclusions of this review, regarding both immediate and deferred action, should
                    be submitted by August 1, 1980. Preliminary comments should be submitted by
                    early June, before the Venice Summit.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Jimmy Carter</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
